      "content": "i dont even know what to do anymore. everything is just gone. the bank called today about the house and i just... i cant breathe. i've worked so hard for so long and now it's just all for nothing. i feel like such a failure. my family is going to lose everything because of me. i just want it all to stop. i feel so trapped.",
